      "before": [
        {
          "eyebrow": "A yearly tradition",
          "heading": {
            "lead": "A whole car",
            "accent": "full of stories."
          },
          "paragraphs": [
            "We spent quite a while planning this session. The family had rented a beautiful villa in Praiano, were still getting to know the area, and had a lot to organise. I waited for them at a car park in Positano, where an enormous car arrived and out came the whole family.",
            "To my delight, they were wonderfully prepared for the photographs. They do this every year, in a different place. They knew how to pose, enjoyed being together, and made my part of the morning very easy."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "spreads",
      "eyebrow": "02 / Time together",
      "heading": {
        "lead": "One hour",
        "accent": "became two."
      },
      "frameIds": [
        "cnr1045",
        "cnr1060",
        "cnr1086",
        "cnr1120",
        "cnr1155",
        "cnr1217",
        "cnr1313",
        "cnr1351",
        "cnr1522",
        "cnr1595",
        "cnr1711"
      ],
      "before": [
        {
          "eyebrow": "Time together",
          "heading": {
            "lead": "One hour",
            "accent": "became two."
          },
          "paragraphs": [
            "Getting everyone ready and over to Positano meant we missed golden hour. By the time we reached my favourite spots, other people were beginning to arrive. But it was still early, with lovely light and plenty of room to work.",
            "The hour we had planned became two wonderful hours together. We had sunshine, the town behind us, and a family who were comfortable enough with one another to make every combination of people feel natural."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dissolve",
      "eyebrow": "03 / For the family album",
      "heading": {
        "lead": "A place",
        "accent": "on the wall."
      },
      "frameIds": [
        "cnr1766",
