        "cnr2468"
      ],
      "before": [
        {
          "eyebrow": "For the family album",
          "heading": {
            "lead": "A place",
            "accent": "on the wall."
          },
          "paragraphs": [
            "After the session, we spent time on the finishing touches. The family had particular wishes for the photographs, and I was happy to work through the details. There was plenty of retouching, but it mattered to me that the people and the feeling of the morning still looked like themselves.",
            "I hope these find a place in their family album. Perhaps one will be printed large, framed, and hung above a fireplace. I like imagining it bringing them back to Positano for a moment, long after the trip is over."
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
